@startuml 03_level2_p2
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #FEF3C7

title PPMP - Level 2 decomposition of 2.0
rectangle "System Administrator" as A
usecase "6.0\nRecord Audit Events and Notifications" as P6
database "D1 Identity and Access\nusers, departments, memberships, roles,\npermissions, role assignments, sessions" as D1
database "D2 Planning Reference Data\nfiscal years, planning groups, owner mappings,\nitems, units, expense objects, annual prices,\nfunds, methods, allocations, workflow templates" as D2
usecase "2.1\nAuthorize Reference Change" as P21
usecase "2.2\nValidate Mappings, Prices and Workflow" as P22
usecase "2.3\nPersist Versioned Reference Data" as P23

A --> P21 : F007 Catalog, planning and workflow changes\n[SETUP_CHANGE]
P23 --> A : F008 Reference-data result\n[SETUP_RESULT]
D1 --> P21 : F009 Administrator permission scope\n[ACCESS_RECORDS]
D2 --> P22 : F010 Existing reference records\n[REFERENCE]
P23 --> D2 : F011 Validated reference records\n[REFERENCE_WRITE]
P23 --> P6 : F061 Process 2.0 audit / notification event\n[DOMAIN_EVENT]
P21 --> P22 : 2.01 Authorized reference-data proposal\n[VALID_SETUP]
P22 --> P23 : 2.02 Validated reference changes\n[VALID_REFERENCE]
legend bottom
Rectangle = external role; oval = data-transforming process
Cylinder = logical data store; arrow = named data payload
U groups all roles for shared login, reports and inbox functions.
Numbered process peers in Level 2 are outside the decomposed process.
Packet fields: FLOW_REGISTER.md; relationships: DATA_DICTIONARY.md
endlegend
@enduml
